{
  "_readme": "Single source of truth for 'which thread owns which file' (version 2, re-cut from the code structure). Paths are relative to the repo root, globs use * and **. When several patterns match a file, the most specific one wins (exact path > longer literal text). Run: node .claude/threads/check-ownership.mjs   (see CLAUDE.md).",
